abstract: >-
  Deterministic, standard-library Python reference for OES-32 telemetry triage:
  max-absolute residual with a strict-exceedance latch, EVEN/ODD sector symmetry,
  and FOLD8 ring continuity on 32-element vectors. Profile A sidecar to the
  normative residual in oes32-residual (ADR-001). Research software with
  SYNTHETIC test inputs; not certified control software.
keywords:
  - oes32
  - telemetry
  - fault-containment
  - reference-implementation
  - python
